D. Information-bottleneck interpretation
  The tower is not just smaller search.  It is maximal forgetting subject to sufficiency for the current proof predicate.
  HYP-2164 is a low-rate least-positive section; S611 shows it is lossy for lifted floor behavior unless the carry side channel is attached.
  The carry bit has tiny Shannon entropy in the scalar audit, but high relevance: it exactly distinguishes floor shadows from strict shadows.
  This is the rare-event lesson: proof relevance is not proportional to ambient address entropy.

